{"v":4,"catch":"展現你的乒乓球才華！","desc":"《KONAMI’s TABLE TENNIS》是KONAMI於1985年發行的運動遊戲。\n遊戲捕捉了真實乒乓球比賽的樂趣和刺激，比賽取決於瞬間的決定，讓您的反應保持敏銳。\n不要錯過空檔，用扣球將球回擊！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如游戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-11-14","genres":["運動","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/086255f14e14084bd5f471b669b620ef10621ad092772cf40c3f20378936026a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bbe9613555bd253028134eeff07a08b6eb1debb36c95b9d1aeb79df69e2bca96.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a0c589ed8c4d8e352dcb55eb996a90df2fabcd48cdc10ecbae7a47450539a7b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bddfcd962c80c4308528d9bbae11efeb07467ce607a52af37d423c595d087ed1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d06ad2eb0e5fe10ef241007a203223f127cacb52eebf4d3355ceeff2d3b900b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7ae1195994363332afc3e7c66ad62ec7e63b76a2b0343c12f684c244d4613873.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b600209e6000","dlc":[]}